      <p class="lead">A neighbourhood Vedic Nursery growing  Golden Bottal Brush, Kajorina Tapori, Red Machira, Latusa Tapori Plant  and more in living soil — no synthetic pesticides, no shortcuts. Pick a sapling, take it home, watch it grow.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#shop" class="btn btn-primary">Browse the Vedic Nursery</a>
        <a href="#location" class="btn btn-ghost">Find us on the map</a>
      </div>
    </div>

<div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
