<!-- ============ SHOP ============ -->
<section class="shop" id="shop">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="sec-eyebrow">The Nursery Cart</p>
      <h2>Take a sapling home this week</h2>
      <p>Every plant is potted the same week you order, straight from vatika soil. Add a few to your enquiry cart and send us your details — we'll confirm availability and delivery.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="plant-grid" id="plantGrid"><!-- filled by JS --></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ ABOUT ============ -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="sec-eyebrow">About Us</p>
     
<h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);
           font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.3rem);
           color:var(--forest);
           margin:0 0 18px;">
  Growing Green Dreams Since 2020
</h2>

<p>
  Vedic Nursery began its journey in 2020 with a simple belief:
  every space deserves a touch of nature. What started as a small
  backyard garden featuring Golden Bottle Brush and Red Machira
  plants has grown into a nursery dedicated to bringing greenery,
  freshness, and natural beauty to every environment.
</p>

<p>
  We carefully nurture our plants to bring life, elegance, and
  natural beauty to homes, gardens, hotels, offices, resorts,
  and commercial spaces.
</p>

<p>
  Whether you're decorating an interior, designing a landscape,
  or creating a welcoming outdoor space, our collection helps
  transform ordinary places into beautiful green surroundings.
</p>

<p>
  <strong>Our philosophy is simple:</strong> We don't just grow
  plants; we help you create beautiful spaces and a greener
  tomorrow — one plant at a time.
</p>
  </div>
   <div class="about-art">
    <img
        src="images/golden-bottle-brush.png"
        alt="Golden Bottle Brush Tapori Plant"
        class="about-plant-image"
        loading="lazy"
    >
</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ MAP / LOCATION ============ -->
<section class="map-sec" id="location">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="sec-eyebrow">Visit the Nursery</p>
      <h2>Come pick your own sapling</h2>
      <p>Walk the rows yourself before you decide — most people leave with something they didn't plan on.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="map-grid">
      <div class="map-embed">
        <!-- Replace the src query below with your exact address or lat/long for an accurate pin -->
        <iframe
          src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=New+Delhi&output=embed"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          title="Map to Organic Organic Vedic Nursery">
        </iframe>
      </div>
      <div class="map-info">
        <h3> Vedic Nursery</h3>
        <div class="addr-line">📍 <span>Location : Chauhan Patti, Soniya Vihar, Delhi-110094, India</span></div>
        <div class="addr-line">🕒 <span>Open daily, 8:00 AM – 7:00 PM</span></div>
        <div class="addr-line">📞 <span>  Contact no: 7982581374</span></div>
        <p>Tap below to open turn-by-turn directions in Google Maps.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Organic+Vedic+Nursery+New+Delhi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Directions →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

